    "## CONCEPT: Survival rate of a group\n",
    "\n",
    "- `survived` is 1 or 0. So the **mean** of `survived` = the **part of people who survived**.\n",
    "- Example: the mean is 0.74 → 74% survived.\n",
    "- `df.groupby(\"gender\")[\"survived\"].mean()` = survival rate for men and for women.\n",
    "- `sns.barplot(data=df, x=\"gender\", y=\"survived\")` draws this for you."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
